                    install: "not yet", changes: [
                        "Apple Health newest first (T10033, Mo Oct 23: \"send newest first\"): 655 old batches were blocking every new read, so nothing newer than Oct 15 reached the PC. The queue now sends the newest batches first, and the last 14 days are read on their own even while the old backlog is full, so recent days go out ahead of years of history. The backlog keeps draining behind them; the PC merges any repeats.",
