                    install: "INSTALLED over Wi-Fi, Sun Oct 11, 2026, 11:54 PM", changes: [
                        "Recovery (MS-18): the strap's blood-oxygen byte goes into your script's recovery formula as a fraction (0.97), the way the formula expects, instead of as 97, which threw the recovery score off (it sat about 31 points above WHOOP's and hit 100 on 23 days; now about 7 below, never pinned at 100).",
                        "What moved your recovery: blood oxygen is compared with your 14-night normal on the same scale.",
                    ]),
